<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Sanity represents how detached someone is from their humanity due to being exposed to unexplainable void phenomena. Low sanity will eventually lead to madness, which may end up with inhumanization. Low sanity will also twist any social interaction the person is in, potentially spreading their madness among others.-->
  <VAEI_Sanity.description>理智代表了一个人由于暴露无法解释的空虚现象而与人性脱节的程度。理智低下最终会导致疯狂，最终可能导致非人化。理智低下也会扭曲这个人所处的任何社交互动，有可能将他们的疯狂传播给其他人。</VAEI_Sanity.description>
  <!--EN: sanity-->
  <VAEI_Sanity.label>理智</VAEI_Sanity.label>
</LanguageData>
